post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
Omassistant's capability broker is installed.

Add the shell plugin from the Omarchy plugin marketplace, or directly:
  omarchy plugin add https://github.com/trollieske/omassistant-plugin.git --enable

Then bind SUPER + ALT + A (and the omassistant layer rule) in
~/.config/hypr/hyprland.lua; the plugin README has the exact lines.

The broker starts on demand and exits with the shell: no service, no root
helper. pi is managed by Omarchy through mise; run `pi --version` once and
sign in.
MSG
}
